            <div xml:id="m-8caaf0bb-544d-4705-9ab1-69da4a4cbc6a">
              <lg xml:id="m-3361aa92-baec-4658-acb8-504ad619d1b6">
                <l xml:id="m-169daa1d-9884-4c19-9fbe-79672e1796d1" facs="#m-ead937ac-df11-48d1-a932-40988cb0f267" label="text-like">5th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-0822df94-ccdf-4de8-ba4e-6a1dc2706930" facs="#m-e2380783-c58b-460b-ae84-242b774347a9" label="ambiguous">1005</l><l xml:id="m-86379c7c-0ec5-495f-80d7-28d8928a2e1c" facs="#m-77c28c53-7991-40d5-abc4-b41a9b465d5a" label="lyrics-like">a déx- tris est mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-bab773f1-c553-4174-97b5-b9233633c996" facs="#m-cb28693f-d48d-48e5-9143-6e3afad6fd92" label="ambiguous">hi,</l><l xml:id="m-b7abd772-528a-4350-b622-3658d957bf14" facs="#m-7a101ef3-2ff0-4bc6-8ac3-6c02c9cb0607" label="lyrics-like">ne commó¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ab360d3-7313-4d10-8e2a-174d75158050" facs="#m-93264a41-0742-4bfd-b4be-8a4d4ede961b" label="ambiguous">ve- ar.</l><l xml:id="m-fbd6a637-7024-468a-92e1-96542cec524d" facs="#m-0544ae3e-516e-462d-97db-392ab8ad45d7" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-16d57a5d-7c3c-49cf-978d-c2a2e260e544" facs="#m-8ce56305-2323-4df0-8689-c9fd4099f24c" label="lyrics-like">DRopitiare, Dómine, supplicatió-[obtulérunt ad honórem nóminis tui,</l><l xml:id="m-45bf26bd-b1f4-42b1-a0af-0ab1f9cadc6b" facs="#m-69bf063f-e673-41e0-a785-7352c9642827" label="lyrics-like">L nibus nostris : et has oblatiônes cunctis proficiat ad salútem. Per</l><l xml:id="m-7bb56c99-3dae-4d2d-914f-22279ee8b6d1" facs="#m-4f15d6ce-07a8-45e6-9cad-5d18ef338ade" label="lyrics-like">famulórum famularúmque tuárum! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-65dfa5b3-0f0b-4497-a034-94e22a857bdc" facs="#m-252d080c-8a73-4a2f-a873-edef9085f03c" label="lyrics-like">benignus assúme; ut, quod singuli</l><l xml:id="m-ea9ecc85-f25e-4ee8-9a5b-c93006e20b2f" facs="#m-7e5e806e-ff19-4636-afca-b3c83b5af8bf" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-dd2bd91f-3725-41fe-876b-069a5aea984a" facs="#m-864fd20c-5aca-4085-b075-305415940f12" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-32d05d72-c890-4d64-9379-afd6f2e76d78" facs="#m-9ceff597-dd18-4c72-a0ff-5a618460d80b" label="lyrics-like">-nam pé- ti-i" a Dó-mi-no,</l><l xml:id="m-655efab0-dc0c-4b9a-b6e9-75ea8a45f0e0" facs="#m-2455d10a-d506-4794-ad80-6b744faf9325" label="ambiguous">hanc</l><l xml:id="m-0ab11000-6012-4ada-b6f2-6aa198b0dcf5" facs="#m-0e4e485b-8487-4128-9fdb-6695e5ab4c62" label="lyrics-like">re- quí- ram: ut inhábi-tem in dó-mo Dómi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-de55ee3c-a823-41e8-aab5-3e26766809ec" facs="#m-c7414b18-f2dc-4e36-b0c0-3e92c97d671e" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus di-é-bus ví-tae</l><l xml:id="m-a6bc6713-f880-4682-9cf9-0a428f08916e" facs="#m-acf0e382-3d47-4bde-9d3f-6ae4cf251ef2" label="lyrics-like">mé¬ ae.</l><l xml:id="m-72eab354-bafa-4606-8817-a6de887740ec" facs="#m-8b686a2f-a306-4d33-9354-67ac1399186f" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-264fd846-e1df-4418-a023-5c6741ce36f3" facs="#m-80722003-4b46-4826-80ff-04582dbc7a8c" label="lyrics-like">Uos caelésti, Dómine, dono sa¬ hóstium liberémur insidiis. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3700750-7f3d-4745-95cb-272d654e4b16" facs="#m-db1ef318-1c3d-468f-8dec-4c8b08f3f256" label="lyrics-like">U tiásti: praesta, quaésumus; ut minum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-515c4546-a470-445c-8982-75164a44498e" facs="#m-7782bbb4-cf15-4ae8-827b-4d26030ac4fc" label="lyrics-like">a nostris mundémur occúltis, et abl</l><l xml:id="m-31d2e55f-a9de-4aae-b257-4414d74b12b6" facs="#m-01d98879-b942-4a40-85f0-58f6af64dc2c" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-db9ee434-927d-4fb0-8a99-767428749890" facs="#m-9244957d-35f7-455e-8f8f-b6a7aa3dff73" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-d9aa6dbf-9aa3-4b1b-9e80-779cfed24d21" facs="#m-308ef068-2f0e-4492-922b-7a907ba050d1" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-6c985f54-cc13-4ab4-a4e9-c31b18059bb4" facs="#m-b2f30d44-32a7-4c65-841b-20de6bb9f620" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1. D</l><l xml:id="m-46736213-3a8b-485e-b165-2891b0039fee" facs="#m-1c7c3e91-329d-4dba-a709-7b2fb647164b" label="ambiguous">S</l><l xml:id="m-611aefaf-13c3-42b9-9c3d-76fd4260c2ef" facs="#m-9e5932b1-676d-4c7a-92ef-641d73762d5e" label="lyrics-like">óffers “ múnus tú¬ um ante altá¬ re,</l><l xml:id="m-5636ea24-034f-4a56-8029-c40224525c4d" facs="#m-ad97df76-aaf8-4769-b52d-03d33f6bb6b3" label="lyrics-like">qui-a fráter tú-us hábet á-liquid</l><l xml:id="m-cc55048c-8d5e-4aea-83fc-ee5d897e7582" facs="#m-0e5bec44-d9af-4f2b-94aa-4b6af24df0f8" label="lyrics-like">et recordátus fú-e-ris</l></lg>
            </div>
